WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.980
Nine people are dead in fresh, man-a-poor clashes, and the Chief Minister wants restraint. This is Omni View Asia Pacific, episode 19. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. The Hindu reports the dead are in Khamjong, Ukrul and Kongpokbi, from fighting on Friday and Saturday between Kukki and Naga armed groups. Yesterday, a woman was shot in Khamjong. Today, the count is the wider toll. Chief Minister Y Khamjong Singh said he condemned the killing of civilians, told authorities to restore order.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.480
order, and asked every community to choose dialogue.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:38.020
Officials say unknown assailants shot a 22-year-old mother of five on Friday night in Chasad

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:38.320
Village.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.020
A 42-year-old man was then killed, and 10 houses burned.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:46.680
Perhibitory orders under Section 162 are in force in that village.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.800
Extra forces have gone to Kongpok Beach in Khamjong.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:55.180
Officials say suspected militants on Saturday killed village guards M-Diamay and R-Gangmay,

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:58.980
and a man identified as Ring Kong May in Topon and Makui.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:04.520
The working committee J.T.C. Manipur claims militants beheaded 52-year-old Agin Booar,

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:08.900
and it wants the head returned for burial. Across the region, a court has ordered

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:14.620
Abhijit Dipke and two other cockroach leaders freed, the Guardian reports, as Delhi faces a second

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:19.740
day calling for election chief Gyanesh Kumar to resign. Reuters, cited by the Guardian,

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:25.260
said police held more than 2,000 people on Saturday. Police said most of that day's detainees were

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:30.560
out by Saturday night. Metro stations and mobile internet were back on Sunday. Critics say the

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:35.920
voter list revision favors the Baratia Genata party in office for more than 12 years. UN

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:40.840
spokesperson Thamine Al-Kitan said peaceful assembly must be respected, and he asked for

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:45.920
real dialogue. India's foreign ministry called the UN Line Selective, and an unwarranted

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:51.540
interference in internal affairs. In Western Australia, the Bank West Curtain Economic Center puts

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:56.560
It's 456,000 people in poverty this year, almost 99,000 of them children.

00:01:56.980 --> 00:02:01.360
That is 15.1 percent, up from 11.8 percent in 2021.

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:05.120
The center points to housing costs and incomes that do not cover them.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:10.240
Premier Roger Koch said this budget alone holds a billion dollars of relief on transport,

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:15.160
school costs, and fuel, and that every level of government has to stop people falling through.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:21.200
Opposition leader Basil Zempelis said 15 percent on or below the line means the state support

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:26.020
is not working. He wants the focus on housing, health, police, and the cost of living.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:32.560
Also today, a cargo ship reported as Sun-9-3 reached the Ferry-MV-Auka about two in the morning,

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:37.520
local time. After at least 73 people spent more than two days adrift into Motu,

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:42.100
between Takopia and Vanacoro. Firefly has cancelled every subang to

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:47.140
Salatar return flight through Monday because of Hayes, CNA reports, and is offering Malaysia

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.160
Asia Airlines seats via Kuala Lumpur in Changi, or a full refund within 30 working days.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:57.420
Narendra Modi reached poorer by-pass to open the Punamali to Vada Polani Metro stretch,

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.960
and projects he said are worth more than 13,000 crore rubies.

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:07.000
At Mandelika, 18-year-old Maximo Kiles won Moto 3 in the world title with 5 rounds left,

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.880
his 10th win, ahead of David Almanza and Brian Yury Arte.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:15.680
In the wider world, a United States threat to end the International Criminal Court leaves

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:21.420
Takaiichi in a bind, the Japan Times reports. Japan hosts roughly 60,000 American service

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:26.180
members, and it depends on Washington for its security. The paper says Tokyo will have

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.940
to walk a fine line as it pushes back. On the case on both sides,

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:34.420
Cook and Zempelis are split on whether that billion dollar package is the answer to the rising

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:39.240
poverty rate. Cook's case is that the money is already the practical tool, spread across

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:43.960
fairs, schools, and fuel, because households fall short for different reasons, and that

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.960
At Canberra, the state and local government have to work together.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:49.720
Both accept that many in the state are under pressure.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:55.780
The snapshot they share puts the rate at 15.1 percent, up from 11.8 in 2021.

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:01.360
A sign of progress, Kidwai Institute's home palliative care in Karnataka has reached

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:06.440
more than 3,000 patients and caregivers, the Hindu reports, with home visits and support

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.140
after a death.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:11.700
Looking back over this past week, three threads are worth catching if you miss them.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:18.380
India's cabinet cleared 1.86 lakh core rubies to move renewable power to users, and counting

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:23.100
opened on a 63,701 vote Baratia Janata Party lead in Assam.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:28.860
Japan's new 10-year bonds now pay 3.1 percent, squeezing the money set aside for debt.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.840
Taiwan's president asked Indo-Pacific democracies to stand against China's threats to the

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:34.120
island.

